<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    C/S =  6.36 %			C/S =  3.82 %</p>
<p>	    O/N =  7.63 %			O/N =  3.82 %</p>
<p>	    T/N =  7.63 %			T/N =  3.82 %</p>
<p>		   Feb  12, 1997			Feb 11, 1997</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  5.43 %     1 month forward =  4.41 %</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  6.61 %     2 month forward =  5.77 %</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  7.00 %     3 month forward =  6.33 %</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  7.04 %     4 month forward =  6.45 %</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  7.12 %     5 month forward =  6.65 %</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  7.08 %     6 month forward =  6.69 %</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
